:: Deadwood Raven Shrine
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage lt 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have not followed the shrine path yet.' '你还没有沿参道走到神社。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shrinePerson and C.npc.Tsukihan.init isnot 1>>
  <<set _shrine.scene to 'intro', _shrine.step to ''>>
  <<include 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Intro'>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The steps end beneath a faded red gate. Two stone ravens face the path, their beaks chipped by the weather.
    Beyond them stands a small wooden shrine. A bell hangs above the veranda, its cord neatly tied out of the wind.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    石阶在褪色的朱红门架下到了头。两只石鸦朝着参道，喙尖被风雨磨缺了。
    门后是一间木造小社。廊前悬着一只铃，铃绳扎在一旁，没有随风乱响。
<</language>><br><br>
<<if Weather.isSnow>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Snow fills the gaps between the paving stones. A narrow strip has been swept clear, and little claw prints run along its edge.' '积雪填进石缝，一条窄路被扫得干干净净，边上留着细小的爪印。'>>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Rain drips from the eaves into a stone basin. The ravens have crowded onto a dry beam, leaving a space between them.' '檐上的雨滴进石盆。渡鸦挤在干燥的横梁上，中间留着一小段空处。'>>
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'night'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'A covered lamp lights the steps; beyond its reach, the cedars are black against the sky.' '一盏有罩的灯照着台阶，灯光之外，杉树在夜空下只剩黑色的轮廓。'>>
<<elseif Time.season is 'autumn'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Brown leaves have gathered around the stone ravens. A few more slip through the gate and scrape across the swept paving.' '褐色的落叶积在石鸦脚下，又有几片穿过门架，在扫净的石地上擦过。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'A raven drops onto a stone lantern. Another answers from the trees. The path behind the building narrows between two cedars.' '一只渡鸦落在石灯笼上，树间传来另一只的回应。屋后的窄路夹在两棵杉树之间。'>>
<</if>><br><br>
<<if _shrine.donations gte 2500>>
  <<lanSwitch 'A stack of new cushions sits on a low shelf beneath the veranda eaves.' '廊下的矮架上添了一摞新坐垫。'>><br>
  <span class='subtle'><<lanSwitch 'Quiet prayer reduces stress by an extra 3.' '祈愿时额外缓解3点压力。'>></span><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if _shrine.donations gte 10000>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Fresh tiles patch the roof above the veranda. A second shaded lamp hangs beside the steps, with no bucket left beneath it to catch drips.' '廊上的屋顶补过新瓦，台阶旁添了一盏有罩的灯，底下不必再放接漏水的桶了。'>><br>
  <span class='subtle'><<lanSwitch 'Quiet prayer also relieves 3 tiredness.' '祈愿时还会减轻3点疲劳。'>></span><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrineSafe>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot settle here now.' '你现在没法在这里停留。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<if _shrinePerson>>
    <<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
    <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan looks up at your footsteps. "You came. Sit here; the birds have had enough of your attention for a moment." <<He>> moves a cushion beside <<his>> own, watching to see whether you will take it.' '月羽听见你的脚步便抬起头。“你来了。坐这里，先别光顾着那些鸟。”<<He>>把坐垫挪到自己身旁，眼睛却留意着你坐不坐。'>>
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan sets out a second cup. "I thought you might come by." <<He>> glances towards the gate once, then leaves the cup where it is.' '月羽摆出第二只茶杯。“想着你或许会来。”<<He>>朝门口看了一眼，没有再把杯子收回去。'>>
      <<else>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan greets you with a small nod. "The tea is still warm." <<He>> straightens an unused cushion, then checks whether you have noticed it.' '月羽朝你轻轻点头。“茶还温着。”<<He>>把一只空着的坐垫理整齐，又看了看你有没有留意。'>>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 10 and C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan taps a cushion beside the tray. "Come and tell me something from town. The birds have nothing new to say today." <<He>> moves the papers out of your way.' '月羽拍了拍浅盘旁的坐垫。“来说点镇上的事吧。今天这些鸟翻来覆去，没句新鲜的。”<<He>>把纸张往旁边挪开，给你留着位置。'>>
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 12>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan is rinsing the feeding bowls. One raven waits on the railing, watching each bowl in turn. "You had yours," <<he>> tells it.' '月羽正在洗喂鸟的食碗。一只渡鸦守在栏杆上，一只只碗地盯着看。“你那份吃过了。”<<he>>对它说。'>>
    <<elseif Time.hour lt 17>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan sits by the small writing table, sorting slips of paper from a wooden box. <<He>> puts the lid on when you approach and makes room for you.' '月羽坐在小书案旁，整理木盒里的纸条。见你走近，<<he>>盖好盒子，腾出一块坐的位置。'>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan folds away a cloth and checks the lamp. "I close at six. There\'s a little time yet, if you\'ve come to sit."' '月羽收起一块布，又看了看廊灯。“六点关门。要是来坐坐，还来得及。”'>>
    <</if>>
    <<if _shrine.memory is 'paper_raven'>>
      <br><br><<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan glances at the space beside the biscuit tin where the paper raven stood. "The one you took with you. Has it kept its shape?"' '月羽看了看饼干盒旁原先放纸鸦的位置。“你带走的那只，还没散架吧？”'>>
      <<elseif _shrine.memory is 'bell'>>
        <br><br><<lanSwitch 'The bell cord you worked on hangs straight. Tsukihan follows your glance and gives its knot a careful check.' '你们整理过的铃绳垂得笔直。月羽顺着你的视线看过去，又仔细检查了一遍绳结。'>>
      <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Join Tsukihan on the veranda', '到廊下找月羽'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Veranda'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<if _shrine.work isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 15>>
      <<icon 'broom-dustpan.png'>><<lanLink ['Join Tsukihan at work (0:15)', '陪月羽料理神社的事 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Work'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'work'>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<if _shrineTsukihanLocation is 'shopping_centre'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A note is tucked beneath the empty basket hook: "In town for supplies. Back for lunch." The broom has been put away, and the courtyard is quiet.' '挂篮子的木钩下压着一张便条：“下山买东西，午饭前回来。”扫帚已经收好，庭院里静悄悄的。'>><br><br>
    <<elseif Time.hour is 12>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A faint smell of hot rice drifts from the house. The sweeping can wait until after lunch.' '小屋那边飘来一点热饭的香气。扫庭院的活，要等吃过午饭再说了。'>><br><br>
    <<elseif _shrineTsukihanLocation is 'raven_shrine_garden'>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A watering can clinks against the stones behind the house. Tsukihan has put the tea things aside for now and gone to tend the fruit trees.' '屋后传来水壶碰上石头的轻响。月羽暂且收好茶具，去照看果树了。'>><br><br>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'The feeding bowls are stacked beneath the eaves, and the broom rests beside the step. The courtyard is still open, though Tsukihan has finished work for the day.' '食碗摞在檐下，扫帚靠在台阶旁。庭院仍可停留，月羽已经收工了。'>><br><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.init is 1>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/tsukihan-home.png'>><<lanLink ['Go round to the living quarters', '绕到屋舍门前'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Door'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-home-context>>
      <<if _shrineHomeReady and $location is 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
        <<set _shrine.home_action to ''>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _shrine.prayer isnot Math.floor(Time.days)>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/prayer.png'>><<lanLink ['Sit quietly with a wish (0:15)', '静坐祈愿 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Daily'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'prayer'>>
    <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><br>
    <<if $money gte 500 and !pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
      <<icon 'raven-shrine/offering.png'>><<lanLink ['Leave £5 and sit quietly (0:15)', '投下£5，再静坐一会儿 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Daily'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'donate'>>
      <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/plaque-rack.png'>><<lanLink ['Walk over to the water basin and wish plaques', '到手水舍与绘马架边看看'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Grounds'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/fruit-trees.png'>><<lanLink ['Go round to the fruit trees', '绕到屋后的果树边'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Garden'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/pond.png'>><<lanLink ['Go round to the pond', '绕到池塘边'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Pond'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<icon 'raven-shrine/path.png'>><<lanLink ['Take the path back to the forest (0:15)', '沿参道返回森林 (0:15)'] 'Forest'>>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-context>>
  <<if _shrineTravel and $location is 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
    <<set _shrineSource to $passage>><<pass 15>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-context>>
    <<if _shrineTravel and $passage is _shrineSource and $location is 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
      <<set _shrine.scene to '', _shrine.step to ''>>
      <<set $location to 'forest', $outside to 1, $forest to _shrine.forest, $eventskip to 1>>
      <<endevent>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Veranda
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage isnot 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer at the shrine.' '你已经不在神社了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or C.npc.Tsukihan.init isnot 1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The veranda is empty. The cups have been put away, and a folded cloth covers the tray.' '廊下空着。茶杯已经收好，一块叠起的布盖在浅盘上。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan moves a few loose papers off the cushion beside <<him>>. "Sit down, if you have time." A raven hops along the railing, peering at the covered tray.' '月羽把身旁坐垫上的几张散纸挪开。“有空的话，坐吧。”一只渡鸦沿着栏杆跳过来，探头看了看盖着布的浅盘。'>><br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
  <<if _shrine.donations gte 10000>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Rain patters over the repaired tiles. The boards beneath your cushion stay dry; Tsukihan leaves the buckets stacked by the door.' '雨点落在补好的瓦上，坐垫下的廊板仍是干的。月羽把水桶摞在门边，没有再拿出来。'>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Rain patters just beyond the eaves, leaving a narrow dry strip beside the wall.' '雨点落在檐外，靠墙的廊板留着窄窄的一段干处。'>>
  <</if>><br><br>
<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Snow has settled along the outer railing; the boards beneath the eaves have been swept clear.' '外侧栏杆上积着雪，檐下的廊板已经扫干净了。'>><br><br>
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'dusk'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Daylight reaches only the outer edge of the low table now; the boards beside the wall are dim.' '天光只落在矮桌外沿，靠墙的廊板已经暗了下来。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and C.npc.Tsukihan.lust gte 30 and _shrine.close isnot Math.floor(Time.days)>>
  <<lanSwitch 'When you turn towards the gate, Tsukihan catches your eye. "If you have time, I would like a moment with you. Just us." <<He>> waits for your answer.' '你望向院门时，月羽叫住了你。“要是不赶时间，想和你单独待会儿。”<<He>>看着你，等你回答。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if _shrine.talk isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 10 and !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Chat with Tsukihan (0:10)', '和月羽聊一会儿 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Talk'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'talk'>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-raven-gift-link>>
<<deadwood-tsukihan-affection-links 'flirt'>>
<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.init is 1 and (_shrineConfessionReady or _shrine.promise gte 0 or C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 10 and _shrine.favour isnot Math.floor(Time.days))>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink [!_shrineConfessionReady and _shrine.promise gte 0 ? 'About the strawberries you promised' : 'See what Tsukihan wants', !_shrineConfessionReady and _shrine.promise gte 0 ? '说说答应带来的草莓' : '看看月羽有什么小要求'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Favour'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-context>>
    <<if _shrinePerson and C.npc.Tsukihan.init is 1 and (_shrineConfessionReady or _shrine.promise gte 0 or C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 10 and _shrine.favour isnot Math.floor(Time.days))>>
      <<set _shrine.favour_result to ''>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 10 and _shrine.tea isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 15 and !pcAreArmsBound('both') and !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <<icon 'orchard/tea-tray.png'>><<lanLink ['Have tea with Tsukihan (0:15)', '和月羽喝杯茶 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Tea'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'tea'>>
  <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<glove>><br>
<</if>>
<<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and _shrine.close isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 10
  and !pcAreArmsBound('both') and !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask for time alone together', '问月羽能否单独待会儿'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Close'>>
    <<deadwood-raven-shrine-context>>
    <<if _shrinePerson and C.npc.Tsukihan.init is 1 and isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and _shrine.close isnot Math.floor(Time.days)
      and _shrineMinutes gt 10 and !pcAreArmsBound('both') and !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
      <<set _shrine.scene to 'close', _shrine.step to ''>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<br><<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Pond
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage isnot 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer at the shrine.' '你已经不在神社了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<lanSwitch 'A narrow path runs behind the shrine to a small pond. There is room to sit on the low wall, clear of the moss.' '一条窄路从神社后面通向池塘。矮墙上有一段没长苔，可以坐下来歇脚。'>><br><br>
<<if Weather.isFrozen('lake')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Ice covers the pond, with a few leaves caught beneath its cloudy surface.' '池面封着冰，几片落叶冻在浑白的冰层里。'>>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Raindrops spread overlapping rings across the water.' '雨点在水面敲出一圈圈重叠的涟漪。'>>
<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Snow lies along the banks, framing a patch of dark, still water.' '积雪围着池岸，中间露出一片暗而平静的水面。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Water trickles between the stones at the edge, stirring the reeds below.' '水沿着岸边的石缝缓缓流入，带动下方的芦苇轻轻摇晃。'>>
<</if>><br><br>
<<if _shrine.donations gte 5000>>
  <<lanSwitch 'A small canopy now shelters a pair of low stools beside the pond.' '池边添了两张矮凳，上方搭着一顶小雨棚。'>><br>
  <span class='subtle'><<lanSwitch 'Resting by the pond reduces tiredness by an extra 3.' '池边休息时额外减轻3点疲劳。'>></span><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if _shrineSafe>>
  <<if _shrinePerson and C.npc.Tsukihan.init is 1>>
    <<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan comes round the corner carrying an empty feeding bowl. <<He>> stops beside you, following your gaze across the pond.' '月羽拿着空食碗从屋角转过来，在你身旁停下，也望向池塘。'>><br><br>
    <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20 and _shrine.walk isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 20 and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and $leftleg isnot 'bound' and $rightleg isnot 'bound'>>
      <<walkicon>><<lanLink ['Walk around the shrine together (0:20)', '和月羽在神社附近走走 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Walk'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'walk'>>
      <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><<glove>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20 and _shrine.kiss isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineMinutes gt 5
      and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
      <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Ask Tsukihan for a kiss (0:05)', '向月羽讨一个吻 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Together'>>
        <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'kiss'>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<if _shrine.rest isnot Math.floor(Time.days)>>
    <<icon 'raven-shrine/pond.png'>><<lanLink ['Rest beside the pond (0:10)', '在池塘边歇一会儿 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Daily'>>
      <<deadwood-raven-shrine-act 'rest'>>
    <</lanLink>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>
